S-Shark!

923
00:26:27,770 --> 00:26:31,530
This could be the solution to
the accelerated growth issue!

924
00:26:31,530 --> 00:26:35,740
Heart rate over 90 BPM!
Green blood is flowing faster!

925
00:26:38,540 --> 00:26:43,080
Show 'em what you're made of!

